| `scripts/run_date.py` | The one definition of the date a whole gate run calls today: the evidence writer fixes it once, and the doc review and check_X read it, so a run that crosses midnight judges by one day. A supplied date is checked every time it is read. | imported; `make verify` fixes it | [`evidence.run_date.env`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evidence.run_date.max_age_days`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Moves today back by at most the configured age, never forward. Not a clock for anything outside a gate run. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
